if mibBuilder.loadTexts: vRtrIfNameTable.setDescription('This is a read-only table, each row of which represents a one to one\n         equivalence between a router interface name (vRtrIfName) and its\n         corresponding index in the vRtrIfTable (vRtrIfIndex).')
